The ARC on my PC164 has a command to "run a program"... see if
yours does too, and if it does, this might work... but don't
blame me if it doesn't!

You have a .rom image file of ARC (or AlphaBIOS); now go see
if you can find the download for the SRM for this board. The
SRM will include two files, fwupdate.exe and the .ROM file for
SRM.

