I ran into a problem with them... If you use them with Adaptec and MILO, the
MILO will not see the drives correctly. Seems the Elsa will latch onto the
same
IRQ as the Adaptec and that's where your problems begin. MILO finds the
adaptec, but will not see the drives on the Adaptec scsi card(s).

